    "result_text": "All tests green. Here's what I implemented.\n\n## Summary\n\nI added idempotent create support to `POST /api/owners` so that a repeat carrying an already-seen `Idempotency-Key` replays the originally created owner with **200** instead of running the create pipeline again (which would otherwise reject the repeat as a duplicate with 409).\n\nFollowing the project's OfficeFloor function-injection conventions (function classes wired in YAML, not `@RestController`), I added a branch at the front of the pipeline and a recording step near the end.\n\n**New function classes** (`rest/function/owner/`):\n- `IdempotencyStore` \u2014 a `@Component` singleton holding an in-memory `key \u2192 ownerId` map, injected by type like the other Spring beans.\n- `IdempotencyKey` \u2014 a small record type (distinct from bare `String` so it's matched unambiguously as a pipeline variable) carrying the header value.\n- `CheckIdempotencyKey` \u2014 reads the optional `Idempotency-Key` header via `ServerHttpConnection` (null-safe, so keyless creates still work), republishes it as a variable, then branches through two `@Flow` outputs: `replay` (key seen \u2192 hands the stored owner id onward) or `fresh` (normal create). Only touches the in-memory store, so no governance needed.\n- `LoadOwnerById` \u2014 loads the original owner by id (under `readonly-transaction`) for the replay path.\n- `RecordIdempotencyKey` \u2014 after `SaveOwner`, records `key \u2192 owner.getId()` (no-op when no key was sent).\n\n**YAML wiring** (`officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml`):\n- New first step `idempotency` with `outputs: { replay: replayLoad, fresh: validate }`.\n- `replayLoad` \u2192 `replayRespond` (reusing the existing `RespondWithOwner` 200 responder), both under `readonly-transaction`, mirroring the GET-owner read path.\n- Inserted `record` between `save` and `respond` (under `transaction`).\n\n**Verification:** `./mvnw -o test` \u2192 `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 `AcceptanceTest.coreIdempotentRepeat` (first create 2xx, repeat with same key returns 200 and the same id) passes, and the full suite is green.",
